'''Chroma Fang''' is a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Knife Box 2]] or through trading.

==Appearance==
It has a split blade attached to the large black spider guard. The tip of the blades are slightly wider than the rest of the blades, and these blades resemble the spider’s fangs, hence the name. The handle, attached to the bottom of the spider, is black with a paracord design over it and a pointed flame pommel. The whole knife alternates in color from the blade to the handle.

==Trivia==
*It is the chroma counterpart of the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife under the name [[Fang]], which can be found in the same box.
*Its model derives from the limited Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/116693735/Fang-Of-Anansi Fang Of Anansi]. However, it has been altered from an orange color to a color-alternating texture, and the flame effect was removed.
*Like all the other [[Chroma Weapons]], it is not salvageable in the crafting station.
*It was released along with the [[Season 1]] update.
*This and [[Fang]] have a similar throw animation to [[Deathshard]], [[Chroma Deathshard]], and [[Winter's Edge]].
*Like many other [[Chroma Weapons]], it lost a lot of [[value]] due to being [[The Duping Glitch (2021)|duped]].

